The original FORTRAN source of Colossal Cave Adventure was written by
Will Crowther (1976) and extended by Don Woods (1977). It was
distributed without a license notice and is widely treated as public
domain; this repository does not claim copyright on the original game
source or its database file.

All additions in this repository -- build scripts, runtime shims
(IFILE, RAN, GETIN rewrite), source patches, and the
WebAssembly/browser runner -- are licensed under the ISC License:

